# <type>(<scope>): <subject>      # e.g. feat(core): add MRU section
#                                  #      fix(accessibility): trap focus in dialog
#
# Types: feat | fix | docs | refactor | perf | test | ci | chore
# Scopes: core (client bundle) | build | docs | ci | test
#
# - Subject: imperative, <= 72 chars, English preferred
# - Body: what & why (not how), wrap at 72 chars
# - Keep each commit focused on one concern
